  "body": "## What fails\n\n`camcraft-app` (lib) does not compile on `origin/main` at `5c05d0660`.\n\n```\nerror[E0004]: non-exhaustive patterns: `&operation::types::params::OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr { .. }` not covered\n   --> crates\\app\\src\\commands\\operation\\recipe.rs:78:11\n```\n\n## Cause\n\nTwo merges meet in one match:\n\n- PR #3399 (cut recipes) adds `has_saved_geometry` in `crates/app/src/commands/operation/recipe.rs:70-130`. It matches each `OpParams` variant.\n- Commit `800d05c57` (Multi-Axis Deburr, kind 46) adds the variant `OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr`.\n\nEach side builds alone. The merge result does not build.\n\n## What to do\n\n- Add the `OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr` arm to `has_saved_geometry`.\n- Decide if the operation has saved source coordinates. The 3-axis `Deburr` arm returns `!exclude_edges.is_empty()`. Use the same rule if `MultiAxisDeburr` has a list of excluded edges.\n- Add a pin test in the recipe tests.\n\n## Found by\n\nThe issue worker for #3587. Its debug build of `pocket_pass_start` failed on this error.\n",
